aether-ac3
==========

Pure Rust AC-3 / E-AC-3 decoder.

This crate is a Rust translation of the decoding logic found in FFmpeg's
libavcodec (ac3dec.c, eac3dec.c, ac3.c, ac3dsp.c, ac3_parser.c, ac3tab.c,
ac3dec_data.c, eac3_data.c, kbdwin.c) and libavutil (lfg.c). It follows the
FFmpeg float decoder step by step so that its output matches FFmpeg's.
The coefficient tables in src/tables_gen.rs are extracted mechanically from
FFmpeg's eac3_data.c and ac3.c by tools/gen_tables.py.

